OL,3,GNEWSANever give up: event gives
OL,4,Astudents hope after exams
OL,5,
OL,6,FA careers advice event has given GCSE
OL,7,Fand A-level students hope about their
OL,8,Ffuture education and employment
OL,9,Foptions.
OL,11,FPeterborough City Council and the Youth
OL,12,FHubs organised two events for young
OL,13,Fpeople who were uncertain about their
OL,14,Fnext steps after receiving their exam
OL,15,Fresults.
OL,17,FThe city has one of the highest levels
OL,18,Fof 16-17 year-olds Not in Education,
OL,19,FEmployment, or Training (NEETs) in the
OL,20,Fcountry.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,379,370,200,160,0,100
