OL,3,GNEWSANever give up: event gives
OL,4,Astudents hope after exams
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne student, Euan, said: "It's a good
OL,7,Fplace to understand what jobs and
OL,8,Feducation you could get into. It's
OL,9,Fgiven me a lot of confidence to find
OL,10,Fsomething that suits me and gives me
OL,11,Fthe opportunity to do what I enjoy.
OL,12,FIt's given me hope that I can still
OL,13,Fpursue the things I'm interested in."
